@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Room catalogue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room-types

### Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability?checkIn=2030-06-10&checkOut=2030-06-13&rooms=1&adults=2&children=0

### Create a pending booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkIn": "2030-06-10",
  "checkOut": "2030-06-13",
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 0,
  "guestName": "Marie Rakoto",
  "guestEmail": "marie@example.com",
  "guestPhone": "+261 34 00 000 00",
  "rooms": [{ "roomTypeId": "classic", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Contact inquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marie Rakoto",
  "email": "marie@example.com",
  "phone": "+261 34 00 000 00",
  "subject": "Stay enquiry",
  "message": "I would like more information about my stay."
}

### Event inquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/event-inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marie Rakoto",
  "email": "marie@example.com",
  "eventDate": "2030-07-15",
  "guestCount": 80,
  "message": "Please send a proposal for a conference."
}
